<view wx:if="{{recipe}}" class="detail"><image class="hero" mode="aspectFill" src="{{recipe.image}}"/><view class="body page"><view class="title">{{recipe.title}}</view><view class="meta">{{recipe.minutes}} 分钟 · {{recipe.kcalLabel}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{recipe.description}}</view><view class="section">搭配建议</view><view class="card copy">蔬菜约占餐盘一半，蛋白质约占四分之一，主食份量按实际食量和专业建议调整。记录前请确认餐别和实际份量。</view><button class="button-primary" bindtap="record">{{buttonText}}</button></view></view>
